WEBVTT

00:08.100 --> 00:11.740
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.740 --> 00:15.100
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:15.370 --> 00:18.880
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.880 --> 00:21.810
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:22.580 --> 00:26.020
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:26.020 --> 00:29.510
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.750 --> 00:32.810
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:33.520 --> 00:35.990
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.890 --> 00:39.000
Don't be afraid

00:39.000 --> 00:40.660
Going from one push after another

00:40.660 --> 00:42.500
The surprising feeling is nice

00:42.500 --> 00:43.900
And you end up dancing till morning

00:44.540 --> 00:46.140
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:46.140 --> 00:49.590
TROPICANA

00:51.540 --> 00:54.850
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.850 --> 00:58.250
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.720 --> 01:02.350
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:02.350 --> 01:05.480
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.990 --> 01:09.590
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:09.590 --> 01:12.620
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:13.200 --> 01:16.730
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.730 --> 01:19.900
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:23.010 --> 01:24.970
Haré! Wake up!

01:27.540 --> 01:29.570
M-Morning...

01:29.780 --> 01:31.510
It's morning! Wake up, wake up!

01:32.220 --> 01:33.120
What's wrong?

01:33.120 --> 01:35.850
It's unusual that
you'd wake up before me, Mom.

01:37.650 --> 01:38.920
Did something happen?

01:39.590 --> 01:41.790
Happy Birthday, Haré!

01:43.460 --> 01:47.330
That's right, I'm turning 11 today.
It's a little surprising.

01:47.400 --> 01:48.560
Oh, why?

01:48.830 --> 01:52.630
Usually, I think, "It's almost my birthday,"
from about a week before.

01:52.770 --> 01:55.430
But this year, I'd forgotten until just now.

01:55.640 --> 01:56.800
You're a strange kid.

01:56.870 --> 01:58.810
You're not that old yet.

01:58.910 --> 02:00.010
You're right.

02:00.010 --> 02:00.910
I wonder why.

02:01.580 --> 02:03.410
I don't know what's going on,
but congratulations.

02:08.020 --> 02:08.780
I see.

02:08.950 --> 02:13.890
I haven't had time to think about birthdays
and stuff lately.

02:16.430 --> 02:19.400
Fantasy Jungle

02:19.860 --> 02:24.390
I'm putting all my effort into making a feast,
so be sure to come home early!

02:24.570 --> 02:26.500
Okay! I'll be going now!

02:30.470 --> 02:31.910
I give up...

02:37.810 --> 02:39.280
Morning, Marie.

02:39.450 --> 02:40.780
Congratulations, Haré!

02:41.320 --> 02:42.410
Your birthday!

02:43.320 --> 02:44.510
You remembered?

02:44.720 --> 02:46.750
Of course I did! That's to be expected!

02:47.290 --> 02:48.760
R-Really?

02:49.560 --> 02:50.490
It's Haré!

02:52.030 --> 02:53.000
Congratulations!

02:53.060 --> 02:54.720
Congratulations! Congratulations!

02:56.470 --> 02:59.900
Yesterday, we were all debating what to get
you as a gift.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.260
Right?

03:02.340 --> 03:04.200
Everyone? Even Gupta?

03:04.570 --> 03:07.200
Although I'd forgotten
until Marie mentioned it.

03:07.480 --> 03:09.340
I can't possibly remember each and every
single thing.

03:09.650 --> 03:13.780
You say that, but you were really worried
about what to get as a gift!

03:13.850 --> 03:16.050
What's that!? You were the same, Uighur!

03:16.550 --> 03:18.710
You don't need to blush. It's not like you...

03:18.820 --> 03:19.690
It's cute!

03:20.090 --> 03:22.750
Shut up, Ravenna! What part of me is
blushing!?

03:23.290 --> 03:24.490
You're blushing. You're blushing.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.890
You're so blushing.

03:29.870 --> 03:31.300
Shut up, all of you!!

03:32.840 --> 03:34.740
Don't make so much noise
so early in the morning!

03:35.210 --> 03:36.830
I went to sleep at 4:00 AM!

03:36.910 --> 03:39.100
Show some consideration, brats!

03:41.080 --> 03:42.340
Wait, what time is it?

03:44.010 --> 03:45.110
8:30.

03:45.780 --> 03:47.510
You were able to sleep for 4 hours.

03:47.620 --> 03:48.410
Shut up!

03:48.590 --> 03:50.280
Don't think in terms of a teenage body!

03:50.350 --> 03:51.690
I'm approaching 30, you moron!

03:52.120 --> 03:55.180
Hey now, don't you think that's going too far
on your son's birthday?

03:56.590 --> 03:57.530
Birthday?

03:57.960 --> 04:00.330
Haré turned 11 today!

04:00.400 --> 04:02.160
Doctor, can you help celebrate?

04:02.930 --> 04:04.230
It's okay, you don't have to.

04:05.370 --> 04:06.500
Celebrate...

04:07.200 --> 04:08.900
I'll think about it.

04:10.370 --> 04:11.270
Wait there for a sec.

04:13.110 --> 04:14.940
I wonder what he's going to give you.

04:15.380 --> 04:16.350
Dunno...

04:19.080 --> 04:20.950
I baked cookies!

04:21.120 --> 04:22.050
Make sure to eat them!

04:22.550 --> 04:24.540
I made pokute marmalade.

04:24.890 --> 04:27.050
It's my gramp's recipe, so it's really tasty!

04:27.620 --> 04:29.650
Wow! Thanks!

04:29.990 --> 04:32.590
I got you the CD
that you've been wanting for a while, Haré.

04:33.030 --> 04:34.620
And I got you a video game.

04:34.830 --> 04:36.530
Thanks, all of you!

04:36.730 --> 04:37.530
Haré...

04:38.570 --> 04:41.060
I made you some clothes, Haré!

04:41.470 --> 04:42.600
Wow!

04:42.670 --> 04:43.540
Open it.

04:43.640 --> 04:46.010
Marie, you're so adept.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.730
I wonder what it's like?

04:49.810 --> 04:51.580
It's a parka!

04:53.680 --> 04:55.410
Isn't it cute? Put it on!

04:55.650 --> 04:58.190
Or rather, Marie, you're too adept.

04:58.190 --> 04:59.380
I can't believe you're only 9.

05:03.460 --> 05:06.020
But, I've seen this before somewhere...

05:07.600 --> 05:08.790
This color...

05:09.130 --> 05:11.120
It's the same one that I have.

05:20.080 --> 05:22.640
If I recall, you made this one, too?

05:22.810 --> 05:23.370
Yes!

05:23.610 --> 05:26.610
I thought it would be so wonderful to have
father and son wearing matching clothing...

05:27.050 --> 05:29.450
To wear something
matching the school doctor...

05:30.150 --> 05:32.250
I don't want to wear something that matches
you.

05:32.720 --> 05:34.590
You can't say that! Not you!

05:34.690 --> 05:35.390
What?

05:35.460 --> 05:38.450
I don't like it! It's the worst to have
something matching you!

05:39.500 --> 05:41.090
I think it's the worst, too!

05:41.200 --> 05:42.220
What!?

05:46.570 --> 05:47.830
You guys don't like it...

05:49.240 --> 05:50.670
I'm so happy about it!

05:50.910 --> 05:52.270
You're happy about it too, right Doc?

05:52.380 --> 05:54.640
Y-Yeah... I'm happy...

05:55.250 --> 05:56.800
Come on, okay?

05:57.410 --> 05:58.240
Yeah...

06:02.850 --> 06:04.790
Anyway, here's your present.

06:05.860 --> 06:07.380
You're really giving me one?

06:09.060 --> 06:10.490
What is it? A book?

06:10.630 --> 06:12.820
A book? You really seem like a father.

06:15.100 --> 06:18.300
In which world does a father give a porn
book to his son!?

06:18.570 --> 06:20.370
Well, I thought it was about time...

06:20.440 --> 06:22.700
For you, who has started climbing the ladder
to adulthood.

06:23.340 --> 06:24.830
What's with this stairway!?

06:26.580 --> 06:28.240
Damn you, damn you, damn you!

06:28.550 --> 06:29.880
What are you doing!?

06:30.010 --> 06:31.610
Even I haven't read that one yet!!

06:31.850 --> 06:33.820
I don't care, you perverted freak!

06:33.880 --> 06:35.150
Don't make fun of porn!

06:35.150 --> 06:36.640
Those that laugh at porn
will cry from porn later!

06:36.720 --> 06:38.450
Don't shout the word
"porn" so much around here!

06:38.520 --> 06:39.680
What's wrong with saying "porn"!?

06:39.960 --> 06:41.550
What an amazing father...

06:41.790 --> 06:43.320
And his son, too...

06:43.460 --> 06:43.760
What's that, you call your own father a
perverted freak... a perverted freak!?

06:43.760 --> 06:44.630
I'm going to write a book about you!
What's that, you call your own father a
perverted freak... a perverted freak!?

06:44.630 --> 06:45.560
I'm going to write a book about you!
What the hell are you talking about?

06:45.560 --> 06:46.900
You sex-crazy old geezer!
What the hell are you talking about?

06:46.900 --> 06:49.760
You sex-crazy old geezer!
You know, you're my son, so that makes you
a perverted freak also!

06:59.640 --> 07:01.580
Today was fun.

07:01.650 --> 07:02.440
Oh?

07:03.310 --> 07:05.150
Other than what happened
with the school doctor...

07:05.150 --> 07:08.170
Can you believe he's an adult? I can't!

07:10.020 --> 07:12.920
I wonder why Mom ever
dated someone like him!

07:13.120 --> 07:14.560
I don't get it at all!

07:17.090 --> 07:19.620
I've been thinking all day...

07:21.870 --> 07:24.330
Should I give you something, too?

07:25.540 --> 07:27.590
Oh, it's all right.

07:27.670 --> 07:29.540
The thought is enough, Guu.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.440
Thanks.

07:32.440 --> 07:34.470
Happy Birthday!

07:42.750 --> 07:44.520
Oh, this is great.

07:44.620 --> 07:46.350
Mom's home-cooked dinner.

07:46.490 --> 07:48.010
It's so warm.

07:48.290 --> 07:50.490
I'm happy about all the gifts I got from
everyone...

07:50.830 --> 07:54.290
I hope I can celebrate every birthday like this.

08:01.870 --> 08:03.030
Present?

08:03.210 --> 08:08.510
Of course
it has to be something that you'd like to
receive, or something that the person wants!

08:08.610 --> 08:11.080
No matter how much it is, receiving
something is always nice.

08:11.950 --> 08:13.610
Mom's voice...

08:14.080 --> 08:15.450
Haré's wish?

08:15.890 --> 08:18.510
Guu-chan, what are you going to do by
finding that out?

08:19.190 --> 08:20.120
Guu?

08:20.190 --> 08:22.160
She's still up?

08:22.460 --> 08:25.290
Hm, I wonder what it is...

08:25.500 --> 08:29.450
Come to think of it, he's been saying that he
wants to hurry up and become an adult.

08:29.670 --> 08:30.830
What's that?

08:30.900 --> 08:33.230
Mom is saying something.

08:33.670 --> 08:35.040
What a strange dream...

08:44.050 --> 08:46.140
Oh, it's morning already.

08:46.520 --> 08:47.880
The room is so bright...

08:48.950 --> 08:50.480
What time is it?

08:50.750 --> 08:52.810
I have to wake up mom.

08:53.890 --> 08:54.550
Huh?

08:55.160 --> 08:57.390
Why am I sleeping in the nurse's office?

09:00.100 --> 09:02.330
My voice is funny... A cold?

09:07.740 --> 09:08.830
What is this?

09:09.210 --> 09:10.230
Is this me?

09:13.080 --> 09:14.410
I'm the school doctor?

09:14.580 --> 09:16.310
Happy Birthday!

09:17.850 --> 09:20.870
Haré, you wanted to
hurry up and become an adult, right?

09:21.050 --> 09:21.880
Guu?

09:22.320 --> 09:24.050
I-It can't be...

09:24.190 --> 09:26.950
Yeah, a gift a day late.

09:27.020 --> 09:28.350
Do accept it.

09:29.190 --> 09:30.450
What's up with that!?

09:30.560 --> 09:32.530
Hey, wait, don't go!

09:32.530 --> 09:33.430
Put me back! Hey!

09:33.700 --> 09:34.860
I'm going to cry...

09:35.130 --> 09:40.000
Dammit!

09:50.250 --> 09:51.680
What is this place?

09:52.550 --> 09:53.380
A dream?

09:54.720 --> 09:56.910
Doctor!

09:59.520 --> 10:01.550
Doctor!

10:03.060 --> 10:04.190
Doctor...

10:05.360 --> 10:06.730
Is this a dream?

10:07.100 --> 10:09.730
Doctor, let's sleep together.

10:09.800 --> 10:12.170
Oh well, I guess a dream is all right.

10:14.500 --> 10:18.270
What kind of a
straight-ball dream am I having?

10:18.410 --> 10:21.570
Doctor, you're so cute. I love you!

10:22.580 --> 10:24.710
You're so warm. You smell like the sun.

10:24.710 --> 10:26.650
You're able to study and cook.

10:26.650 --> 10:28.340
You're a very good boy!

10:30.150 --> 10:31.950
I'm so happy to be your mom!

10:39.430 --> 10:41.360
What? That was just a dream after all?

10:42.000 --> 10:44.830
Why was Weda my mom?

10:45.070 --> 10:46.040
That's a strange dream.

10:46.470 --> 10:48.400
Huh? My voice is funny...

10:55.350 --> 10:56.610
Is something wrong?

11:01.420 --> 11:04.280
W-W-W-Why am I sleeping with Weda-chan?

11:05.290 --> 11:07.780
You don't want to sleep next to me
anymore!?

11:08.220 --> 11:10.090
W-Wait, Weda-chan, you're too aggressive!

11:15.230 --> 11:16.460
W-What's going on?

11:17.970 --> 11:18.900
What's this? Is this me?

11:19.170 --> 11:19.930
It's really me?

11:20.140 --> 11:21.260
Wait, this is my son!

11:21.540 --> 11:23.170
What's going on!?

11:23.910 --> 11:25.270
What's this? Is this me?

11:25.440 --> 11:26.310
It's really me?

11:26.440 --> 11:27.570
Wait, this is my son!

11:27.840 --> 11:29.570
What's going on!?

11:30.810 --> 11:33.510
I was sweating in my sleep.
I think I'll take a bath.

11:33.880 --> 11:35.350
Haré, let's take a bath together.

11:43.960 --> 11:47.490
If you're not going to come with me, fine.
I'll go with Guu-chan.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.990
Guu-chan isn't around, either?

11:50.100 --> 11:51.620
Oh, I'm so disappointed.

11:54.270 --> 11:56.260
Wait, wait, I'll go, I'll go!

11:56.340 --> 11:57.400
Wait!

11:58.240 --> 11:59.770
Don't "Wait!"

12:01.280 --> 12:02.210
Who's that?

12:02.450 --> 12:03.640
Wait, is that me?

12:03.910 --> 12:05.680
So you are the one in there!

12:06.380 --> 12:08.540
You! Give me back my body!

12:08.620 --> 12:11.590
I have a nice situation setup right now, but I
can't do anything about it in this body!

12:11.650 --> 12:13.750
Give it back now. Right now!
Come on! Give it back!

12:13.860 --> 12:15.650
What were you going to do in the bath!?

12:15.790 --> 12:19.420
In the first place, that situation only exists
because you're in my body!

12:19.760 --> 12:21.860
Oh, Doctor, do you need something?

12:23.870 --> 12:25.800
You're wandering around like that again!

12:25.870 --> 12:28.530
I've told you so many times to not wander
around in such an embarrassing state!

12:29.910 --> 12:31.010
Hurry up and wear this!

12:31.010 --> 12:32.130
What'll happen if you catch a cold?

12:33.240 --> 12:36.240
Doctor,
you seem like such a nice person today.

12:36.350 --> 12:37.310
What's wrong?

12:37.680 --> 12:39.610
Hey, she's talking about you.

12:39.820 --> 12:42.510
Am I usually that awful?

12:42.620 --> 12:45.250
Oh no, not Haré. The doctor.

12:45.320 --> 12:47.450
Now, if you're going to bathe,
hurry up and go.

12:47.590 --> 12:48.520
S-Sure...

12:48.630 --> 12:49.960
Sure!

12:50.030 --> 12:51.960
I keep telling you, what's with that, "Sure!"?

12:52.200 --> 12:54.220
Do you realize
the situation that you're in right now!?

12:57.700 --> 13:00.360
Geez, why did this have to happen...

13:02.310 --> 13:04.210
Hey, have you seen Guu?

13:04.440 --> 13:05.440
I haven't seen her.

13:05.440 --> 13:06.640
Does that have something to do with this?

13:07.140 --> 13:08.940
No, it's nothing...

13:09.950 --> 13:12.510
I can't say that Guu is the reason behind this.

13:12.780 --> 13:16.240
Dammit, she's hiding somewhere.

13:16.350 --> 13:17.680
I have to find her!

13:17.950 --> 13:19.820
So, what are we going to do now?

13:21.290 --> 13:22.920
I suddenly turned into a child.

13:23.660 --> 13:25.590
What am I supposed to do now?

13:28.000 --> 13:31.230
The school doctor
didn't ask to become a child...

13:31.330 --> 13:33.230
He just got caught up in all of this.

13:33.440 --> 13:35.170
This sucks.

13:35.170 --> 13:37.940
I can't do anything
as long as I'm in a child's body.

13:39.340 --> 13:42.440
Considering strength,
height, and certain sizes...

13:42.780 --> 13:44.910
I'd have to be a little bit more of an adult...

13:47.880 --> 13:52.080
Well, I'll just wait 2 or 3 years until I become
an adult, and it'll be okay.

13:52.190 --> 13:53.020
What will!?

13:53.090 --> 13:55.750
Well, let's each do our best, Doctor-san.

13:55.960 --> 13:58.090
You're really optimistic about this,
aren't you?

13:58.800 --> 14:00.760
It's called positive thinking.

14:00.860 --> 14:02.560
Can you think at least a little bit on how to
get back to normal?

14:02.770 --> 14:05.330
Oh, it's wonderful to be young...

14:05.500 --> 14:08.200
I can fully take advantage of the privileges of
childhood!

14:08.270 --> 14:09.700
Yeah!

14:10.140 --> 14:12.070
Oh, you need to go to work.

14:12.140 --> 14:13.900
After all, you're the school doctor.

14:14.280 --> 14:14.970
See ya!

14:15.450 --> 14:18.180
You play, and I work?

14:29.330 --> 14:30.220
Wha-!?

14:32.630 --> 14:33.960
Damn him...

14:36.800 --> 14:40.460
Why did I think that I wanted to be an adult?

14:44.340 --> 14:47.370
This is so boring,
or rather, today is a holiday.

14:47.480 --> 14:48.970
Is there any work to do?

14:50.480 --> 14:52.350
I'm hungry...

14:52.720 --> 14:54.980
I wonder what the doctor does for meals.

14:58.890 --> 15:01.250
Dr. Clive, I have your meal!

15:01.690 --> 15:03.490
You always make my meals, Marie?

15:04.260 --> 15:05.390
Of course.

15:07.860 --> 15:09.630
I'll have some now!

15:10.030 --> 15:12.660
I see, Marie's home cooked meals...

15:16.410 --> 15:17.810
It's not horrible...

15:18.210 --> 15:20.270
But it's not great, either.

15:20.840 --> 15:22.330
What's wrong, Doctor?

15:22.410 --> 15:24.510
You always say it's delicious.

15:25.350 --> 15:26.580
It's not tasty?

15:26.950 --> 15:29.320
I-It's delicious! It's the best!

15:29.620 --> 15:30.950
I'm so glad!

15:36.330 --> 15:39.290
This cooking? The school doctor?

15:39.860 --> 15:40.950
Here you go, doctor.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.850
T-Thanks.

15:44.030 --> 15:46.930
Does the doctor have kindness in him?

15:50.470 --> 15:52.960
Doctor, Gupta got hurt.

15:53.380 --> 15:54.930
I'm telling you it's fine.

15:55.010 --> 15:57.640
I'm sure I'll just end up getting antiseptic
poured on me.

15:57.980 --> 16:00.510
We won't know until we ask him.

16:00.580 --> 16:01.680
You sure are aggressive.

16:02.020 --> 16:03.850
Please, can you treat him?

16:04.490 --> 16:05.450
S-Sure.

16:05.520 --> 16:06.610
Where's the wound?

16:08.260 --> 16:10.020
Ow! That looks painful!

16:11.490 --> 16:14.460
Oh, I'm supposed to
wash the wound before I treat it, right?

16:14.860 --> 16:16.530
I can do that myself.

16:19.170 --> 16:19.900
You know?

16:20.240 --> 16:20.760
Huh?

16:20.970 --> 16:22.560
Was the doctor always like that?

16:22.940 --> 16:27.040
Not sure. Though, I thought that he'd
complain a lot more...

16:27.740 --> 16:29.010
He seems like a different person.

16:29.980 --> 16:31.240
All right, it's done!

16:35.950 --> 16:37.680
When you feel like doing your job,
you do it well.

16:38.520 --> 16:39.580
That was unexpected.

16:39.990 --> 16:41.050
Well...

16:41.460 --> 16:42.950
It's not that unexpected.

16:44.230 --> 16:45.230
This little one.

16:45.230 --> 16:48.460
When it broke its leg the other day, the
doctor fixed him up.

16:48.830 --> 16:50.630
I see...

16:52.140 --> 16:54.190
It's all healthy now, right?

16:54.840 --> 16:56.500
The doctor is a good doctor.

16:56.940 --> 16:58.630
I see...

17:05.450 --> 17:08.580
When I take a closer look,
it's not all porn books...

17:09.150 --> 17:11.140
There are really hard books here.

17:11.520 --> 17:13.680
Or rather,
there are far many more books of that sort.

17:22.730 --> 17:25.330
I'm sure it's not easy to become a doctor,
either...

17:25.770 --> 17:28.790
It's not something that you can become in a
day or two, just because you want to.

17:30.470 --> 17:33.810
Well, I'll just wait 2 or 3 years until I become
an adult, and it'll be okay.

17:36.410 --> 17:37.710
That's what he was saying.

17:38.210 --> 17:39.240
But it can't be that easy.

17:39.550 --> 17:41.640
It's tough to become an adult.

17:43.390 --> 17:47.410
There's no way he can easily let go of
everything he's accomplished.

17:47.890 --> 17:51.260
I think I did a bad thing to the doctor by
getting him involved in all of this.

17:52.300 --> 17:53.320
All right!

17:53.400 --> 17:56.230
I'll make sure to find Guu tomorrow, and
have her return us to normal!

17:56.500 --> 17:58.160
For the school doctor as well!

18:13.120 --> 18:13.740
Huh?!

18:26.830 --> 18:28.490
I'm back to normal!?

18:33.140 --> 18:35.130
I'm back!

18:35.240 --> 18:36.640
Shut up!

18:37.310 --> 18:38.500
Mom!

18:39.810 --> 18:40.710
Ah! School!

18:41.280 --> 18:42.540
I'm leaving now!

18:42.710 --> 18:44.010
Okay...

18:46.720 --> 18:48.810
What was the meaning of all this, Guu?

18:49.650 --> 18:53.850
But, I think it was good because I got to
know a lot about the school doctor.

18:55.830 --> 18:58.450
But that's an adult!? I can't believe it at all!

19:00.430 --> 19:02.830
Maybe it was to make me realize that?

19:03.730 --> 19:06.460
To show me what the doctor is really like...

19:11.410 --> 19:13.000
Damn you!

19:13.110 --> 19:14.540
Because of you...

19:14.540 --> 19:17.270
Because of you, I had a hell of a time
yesterday!

19:18.450 --> 19:20.850
Just kidding, though this is usually the time
I'd get angry.

19:21.180 --> 19:22.580
Yo! Good morning!

19:25.290 --> 19:27.480
Thanks for that strange present yesterday.

19:27.920 --> 19:29.190
You liked it?

19:29.530 --> 19:31.520
Though I never want it ever again.

19:31.660 --> 19:35.060
Thanks to you, Guu, I think I might come to
like the school doctor just a little bit.

19:36.970 --> 19:38.260
I'm sure Mom...

19:38.800 --> 19:41.240
...saw a part of the doctor that I haven't seen.

19:46.910 --> 19:48.470
Oh! Haré!

19:51.710 --> 19:53.340
Don't act dumb!

19:53.420 --> 19:55.180
You were flipping everyone's skirts
yesterday, weren't you!?

19:55.350 --> 19:57.340
You hugged me and touched my breasts!

19:57.520 --> 19:59.420
I was kissed without warning!

19:59.490 --> 20:00.980
You touched my butt!

20:01.060 --> 20:02.420
You licked my ear!

20:02.490 --> 20:03.650
You climbed up on my lap!

20:12.200 --> 20:14.860
Oh, it's great to be young.

20:15.000 --> 20:17.630
I can fully take advantage of the privileges of
childhood!

20:17.740 --> 20:19.070
Yeah!

20:19.410 --> 20:22.240
T-That's what he meant!?

20:22.350 --> 20:24.040
I hope you're prepared!

20:24.710 --> 20:26.580
It wasn't me!

20:26.720 --> 20:29.810
It's all a misunderstanding! You'll understand
if I talk it out!

20:29.890 --> 20:31.650
Help me!

21:03.350 --> 21:04.510
It's just me...

21:05.790 --> 21:09.120
But still, I had a strange dream yesterday...

21:22.670 --> 21:24.500
It wasn't a dream!!

22:35.410 --> 22:35.510
NEXT EPISODE

22:35.510 --> 22:36.150
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.150 --> 22:37.680
Eh? You want to eat fish?

22:37.680 --> 22:39.820
Mom is just so selfish. She troubles me so much.

22:39.820 --> 22:41.880
Well, it means that she relies on me,
so it's not that bad a feeling.

22:41.880 --> 22:44.750
Wait. When you look at it objectively,
I'm more of a slave than a son.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.150
NEXT EPISODE

22:45.150 --> 22:45.550
Well, fish, fish...

22:45.550 --> 22:47.390
Hey, Guu, how long are you going to keep
your face down there?

22:47.390 --> 22:48.220
Can it be? Guu?

22:48.220 --> 22:49.890
Agh! You're totally fine!

22:49.890 --> 22:51.590
And, the fishing rod is floating away!

22:51.590 --> 22:52.600
Noooo!

22:52.600 --> 22:54.400
Eh? Guu, you're going to get fish for us?

22:54.400 --> 22:56.330
How? Wait, why are you
attaching a rope to yourself?

22:56.330 --> 22:58.300
Hey, hey, come on! Stop it!

22:58.300 --> 22:59.970
How far are you going to go!?

22:59.970 --> 23:00.540
Hey, wait, who is this?

23:00.540 --> 23:01.340
Hey, wait, who is this?

23:01.340 --> 23:01.770
But, Ms. Yamada

23:01.770 --> 23:04.870
Next Episode of Haré+Guu: But, Ms. Yamada

23:04.870 --> 23:05.500
But Ms. Yamada
